|---|---|---|
| `fn` | `function` | The function you want to throttle. |
| `delay` | `number` (ms) | Milliseconds to wait since the **last** call before executing `fn`. |
| `immediate` | `boolean` | (Optional) If `true`, the function is executed immediately on the **first** call,
